\begin_layout Chapter
Software and architecture
\end_layout

\begin_layout Section
Overview
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
For the creation of the software of this thesis I have written the code with two different AI;
 this has been my first time using AI for the development in Python,
 because I came from the old school of programming and actually I write mostly scripts in Bash and Ansible for my daily work.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
In any case the experience of programming was good and helped me to realize the game with the minimum effort of coding;
 but during the development phase,
 some 
\emph on

\begin_inset Quotes eld
\end_inset

hallucinations
\begin_inset Quotes erd
\end_inset


\emph default
 produced by the artificial intelligence have made me spend some time debugging the code in search of the bugs inserted in the source code.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
After the corrections,
 I have used another artificial intelligence to do a double check of the code and the results;
 after that I have used the knowledge learned with the quantum computing course of IBM and my experience as programmer gained with big headache and sleepless nights to shape the code of the memory game.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
So in this chapter I will face all the development and deployment aspects to make easier for the each reader that would to try make tests on quantum computing with the source code produced with this thesis.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
All the code written and the documentation,
 included also the Lyx files that using to generate this PDF are freely available in the Git repository created for this thesis.
\end_layout

